URL: https://github.com/dosc91/ldlr
BugReports: https://github.com/dosc91/ldlr/issues
Description: A tidy and explicit R interface for fitting Linear Discriminative
    Learning comprehension and production mappings. Computationally intensive
    operations are delegated to Julia and JudiLing without requiring users to
    write Julia code.
